  "description": "Flightline Two 29 features Haro's new 6000 series alloy frame with internal head tube and IS disc mounts. Its 24 speed drive train provides versatility in a variety of terrain while the addition of mechanical disc brakes provides confidence inspiring and sure footed stopping power whenever called upon. Its 29\" wheels are fast rolling and glide through rock gardens and over logs effortlessly which gives the FL Two 29 its unique personality. Built with alloy double wall rims for strength, rust free stainless steel spokes, 32 hole alloy hubs, and finished with 29\" x 2.2\" multi surface tires.\nMY18 FL Two 6000 Series alloy frame w/ IS disc mount\nSuntour M3030 fork w/ 75mm travel, post mount\nShimano FC-TY301, 42x34x24T alloy crankset\nShimano Tourney TX-800 rear derailleur\nShimano ST-EF500 3x8-spd shifters\nShimano HG-200 8-spd cassette 12-32T\nAlloy DW rims w/ Pivit alloy cassette 32h hubs\nAlloy disc brake sets w/ 160mm rotors",
